{"sections":[{"chapter":"Go further with more ressources","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}]}],"backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"kind":"hero","title":"Going further with more resources"},{"tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"stepsSection":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as librairies) with details about everyhting: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can get it at "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null},{"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"icon finder","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get